01:50:50.102 --> 01:50:52.143
Oh, no, I get it, I get it.


01:50:52.278 --> 01:50:53.404
Oh, yeah, yeah.


01:50:54.148 --> 01:50:55.148
Um...


01:50:56.580 --> 01:50:58.112
Look, man, I, uh...


01:50:59.111 --> 01:51:00.818
