<i>Timmy is scared...</i>


01:58:55.128 --> 01:58:57.556
<i>...and that's natural.</i>


01:58:57.692 --> 01:58:59.560
<i>But it isn't good for
him to stay scared.</i>


01:59:00.629 --> 01:59:03.366
<i>Right now, Timmy's
beginning to decide</i>


01:59:03.501 --> 01:59:06.534
<i>if he's gonna stay scared
of things all his life.</i>


01:59:09.736 --> 01:59:11.250
<i>Now, Mission Control</i>


01:59:11.274 --> 01:59:13.475
<i>and the world could only wait.</i>


01:59:17.778 --> 01:59:20.480
<i>Wait for the first
contact with</i> Apollo 8


01:59:20.615 --> 01:59:23.214
<i>as it emerged from
behind the moon.</i>


01:59:25.357 --> 01:59:27.159
<i>See
you on the other side.</i>


01:59:30.393 --> 01:59:31.669
<i>It's mighty hard</i>


01:59:31.693 --> 01:59:34.628
<i>to give children the
kind of care they need.</i>


01:59:35.762 --> 01:59:38.335
<i>Suppose these were
your children.</i>


01:59:40.169 --> 01:59:41.740
<i>What would you do?</i>


02:00:18.207 --> 02:00:19.706
