He's all right!


02:09:17.811 --> 02:09:19.577
He's all right!


02:09:19.713 --> 02:09:22.050
He's fine!


02:09:23.356 --> 02:09:25.518
He's fine, he's fine!


02:09:25.653 --> 02:09:27.388
<i>He's fine.</i>


02:09:27.523 --> 02:09:29.192
<i>He's fine.</i>


02:09:29.327 --> 02:09:30.960
<i>He's fine.</i>


